1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,420
The radiance of the night shines through my window

2
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:11,370
but the path to immortality is long.

3
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:16,100
The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.

4
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:21,260
Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.

5
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:25,250
Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,

6
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,500
I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.

7
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:33,770
The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?

8
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:37,730
I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness

9
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:40,730
as the storm rages just below.

10
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:45,100
I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.

11
00:00:44,850 --> 00:00:48,090
I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals

12
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,940
why the world is a-changing.

13
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:54,290
Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.

14
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:57,460
Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,

15
00:00:57,210 --> 00:01:00,540
experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.

16
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:03,420
I will defy the light in the sky

17
00:01:03,170 --> 00:01:06,860
to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.

18
00:01:15,690 --> 00:01:19,300
Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.

19
00:01:19,210 --> 00:01:22,380
Transform your insignificant body into light.

20
00:01:22,290 --> 00:01:25,500
The hardships of the journey

21
00:01:25,370 --> 00:01:28,460
will temper this young man's heart.

22
00:01:28,210 --> 00:01:33,100
If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?

23
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:43,730
Renegade Immortal
Subtitles by Bonobosubs
https://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

24
00:01:51,440 --> 00:01:54,290
Among my 7 divisions of the Heavenly Fate Sect,

25
00:01:54,240 --> 00:01:56,090
the Yellow and Violet divisions

26
00:01:55,840 --> 00:01:58,890
still don't have Sons of Tian Yun.

27
00:01:59,640 --> 00:02:02,970
Today is the day of the competition

28
00:02:02,960 --> 00:02:06,610
for the Seven Sons of Tian Yun.

29
00:02:08,880 --> 00:02:10,330
Are you all

30
00:02:10,280 --> 00:02:12,210
ready to begin ?

31
00:02:13,120 --> 00:02:14,690
The sect is flourishing

32
00:02:14,720 --> 00:02:16,010
and its disciples are powerful.

33
00:02:16,640 --> 00:02:18,850
But with the Heavenly Fate Sect's heritage,

34
00:02:18,640 --> 00:02:21,930
how is it possible that not a single disciple has surpassed Ascendant ?

35
00:02:23,240 --> 00:02:25,290
Disciple' cultivation is too shallow

36
00:02:25,240 --> 00:02:27,330
and insufficient to compete with my Senior Brothers for the title.

37
00:02:27,520 --> 00:02:28,690
Disciple gives up.

38
00:02:28,960 --> 00:02:30,730
Disciple still needs to cultivate diligently.

39
00:02:30,760 --> 00:02:32,210
Disciple is ashamed to give up.

40
00:02:31,960 --> 00:02:33,490
Disciple forfeits.

41
00:02:33,240 --> 00:02:34,770
Disciple isn't strong enough to compete.

42
00:02:34,520 --> 00:02:37,210
Thanks to all my previous efforts

43
00:02:37,080 --> 00:02:39,690
building relationships with other fellow disciples,

44
00:02:39,640 --> 00:02:42,690
even Senior Brother agreed to yield to me.

45
00:02:42,560 --> 00:02:44,410
Today, I will finally become

46
00:02:44,680 --> 00:02:46,970
a Son of Tian Yun.

47
00:02:47,640 --> 00:02:49,890
The Seven Sons of Tian Yun's status is sky high,

48
00:02:49,960 --> 00:02:51,970
they even have a chance to receive a celestial spell.

49
00:02:53,280 --> 00:02:56,690
Why would these disciples give up so easily ?

50
00:02:57,240 --> 00:02:58,890
Yun Daozi ?

51
00:02:59,520 --> 00:03:01,210
Master,

52
00:03:01,240 --> 00:03:03,690
Second Junior Brother’s cultivation is profound

53
00:03:03,440 --> 00:03:05,890
and he was just given a celestial artifact by Master.

54
00:03:05,960 --> 00:03:10,610
He rightfully should become the Yellow Division's Son of Tian Yun.

55
00:03:10,720 --> 00:03:12,770
Disciple wishes to forfeit

56
00:03:12,520 --> 00:03:15,210
to protect my Second Junior Brother's Dao.

57
00:03:16,840 --> 00:03:18,890
The Seven Sons of Tian Yun

58
00:03:18,880 --> 00:03:22,010
are titles within our Heavenly Fate Sect

59
00:03:22,440 --> 00:03:26,810
and also the name of my true direct disciples.

60
00:03:27,080 --> 00:03:29,890
If you can maintain the title for a 1000 years,

61
00:03:29,840 --> 00:03:31,090
Master

62
00:03:31,080 --> 00:03:33,570
will teach you a celestial spell.

63
00:03:34,040 --> 00:03:35,570
Kunpeng Zi,

64
00:03:35,760 --> 00:03:36,970
you

65
00:03:37,120 --> 00:03:39,130
should prepare yourself.

66
00:03:39,960 --> 00:03:41,930
Disciple humbly follows your teachings.

67
00:03:41,760 --> 00:03:43,930
I will not disgrace the name of Tian Yun.

68
00:03:45,640 --> 00:03:47,610
Cultivate in seclusion

69
00:03:47,680 --> 00:03:50,010
to understand this item.

70
00:03:51,760 --> 00:03:54,770
Those with formidable strength don’t compete for the title.

71
00:03:54,560 --> 00:03:56,490
They make everyone else fear them.

72
00:03:59,240 --> 00:04:00,530
Thank you, Master.

73
00:04:01,080 --> 00:04:03,170
Is there more than meets the eye

74
00:04:03,280 --> 00:04:05,090
to this Son of Tian Yun title ?

75
00:04:05,320 --> 00:04:06,730
Next up

76
00:04:06,840 --> 00:04:09,690
is our Purple Division's

77
00:04:09,440 --> 00:04:12,290
competition to decide the Son of Tian Yun.

78
00:04:12,520 --> 00:04:13,730
Wang Lin,

79
00:04:13,920 --> 00:04:15,170
Zhao Xinmeng,

80
00:04:15,240 --> 00:04:16,370
Bai Wei,

81
00:04:17,080 --> 00:04:18,690
are you three

82
00:04:19,120 --> 00:04:21,290
ready to begin ?

83
00:04:26,440 --> 00:04:28,290
Disciple gives up.

84
00:04:30,840 --> 00:04:31,890
Seventh Brother...

85
00:04:32,120 --> 00:04:33,890
If I give up too,

86
00:04:33,880 --> 00:04:36,970
it would be too easy for you to obtain the title.

87
00:04:37,520 --> 00:04:38,890
You and I shall fight

88
00:04:38,960 --> 00:04:40,330
right here, right now.

89
00:04:41,840 --> 00:04:44,930
Fourth Senior Sister never competed for the title before.

90
00:04:46,040 --> 00:04:48,170
Why is she now challenging me now ?

91
00:04:49,320 --> 00:04:52,250
If I have doubts about the Seven Sons of Tian Yun,

92
00:04:52,120 --> 00:04:54,800
she must also have the same doubts.

93
00:04:58,360 --> 00:04:59,450
Disciple

94
00:04:59,400 --> 00:05:00,410
gives up.

95
00:05:00,960 --> 00:05:03,090
Why are you giving up ?

96
00:05:05,720 --> 00:05:07,290
Disciple’s cultivation is too low.

97
00:05:07,440 --> 00:05:09,330
I'm unable to compete with Fourth Senior Sister.

98
00:05:09,280 --> 00:05:10,690
Wang Lin !

99
00:05:15,720 --> 00:05:17,690
Disciple' cultivation is too shallow

100
00:05:17,440 --> 00:05:19,330
and insufficient to compete with my Senior Brothers for the title.

101
00:05:17,030 --> 00:05:19,330
Disciple isn't strong enough to compete.

102
00:05:19,080 --> 00:05:21,330
Disciple is ashamed to give up.

103
00:05:19,080 --> 00:05:21,330
...to protect my Second Junior Brother's Dao.

104
00:05:24,440 --> 00:05:26,010
That feeling just now

105
00:05:26,640 --> 00:05:28,490
was as if everything about me

106
00:05:28,640 --> 00:05:30,290
was laid bare before him.

107
00:05:32,320 --> 00:05:34,170
My disciples

108
00:05:34,240 --> 00:05:36,690
shouldn't be cowards.

109
00:05:37,240 --> 00:05:39,170
You shouldn't be bewitched by others

110
00:05:38,920 --> 00:05:41,130
and should follow your desires.

111
00:05:41,760 --> 00:05:44,330
I'll give you half an incense stick of time

112
00:05:44,520 --> 00:05:46,570
to think about it carefully.

113
00:05:46,960 --> 00:05:48,970
If you still decide to give up,

114
00:05:49,360 --> 00:05:51,690
I won't stop you.

115
00:05:53,760 --> 00:05:55,770
Master always lets disciples choose.

116
00:05:55,520 --> 00:05:57,330
Why is he advising him today ?

117
00:05:57,960 --> 00:06:00,130
Since Sun Yun,

118
00:05:59,880 --> 00:06:02,890
the only disciple Master advised

119
00:06:02,920 --> 00:06:04,930
is this Wang Lin.

120
00:06:06,440 --> 00:06:08,970
Defying the All-Seer now is unwise.

121
00:06:09,720 --> 00:06:12,610
Even if something's wrong about the Seven Sons of Tian Yun,

122
00:06:12,560 --> 00:06:13,770
this duel

123
00:06:14,040 --> 00:06:16,050
is unavoidable.

124
00:06:17,040 --> 00:06:18,010
Disciple

125
00:06:17,920 --> 00:06:19,490
will try his best.

126
00:06:29,480 --> 00:06:30,690
Seventh Brother,

127
00:06:30,880 --> 00:06:32,210
let's begin.

128
00:06:34,240 --> 00:06:35,730
My Dao is

129
00:06:35,920 --> 00:06:37,530
the Demon's Shadow.

130
00:06:37,840 --> 00:06:39,290
As long as I see a spell once

131
00:06:39,160 --> 00:06:41,090
and its requirements are not beyond my cultivation,

132
00:06:40,840 --> 00:06:43,290
I can imitate a weaker version of it.

133
00:06:43,720 --> 00:06:44,930
This spell

134
00:06:44,880 --> 00:06:46,210
is my imitation of

135
00:06:45,960 --> 00:06:48,450
the Demonic Finger you used before.

136
00:06:48,880 --> 00:06:50,370
I call it

137
00:06:50,560 --> 00:06:52,010
the Purple Demonic Hand !

138
00:06:54,520 --> 00:06:56,010
Demonic Finger !

139
00:07:00,080 --> 00:07:01,930
What an amazing demonic energy !

140
00:07:02,520 --> 00:07:05,570
My Demon's Shadow imitation is still somewhat lacking.

141
00:07:07,040 --> 00:07:08,210
Seventh Brother,

142
00:07:08,320 --> 00:07:11,410
I won’t compete with you for the Son of Tian Yun title.

143
00:07:11,880 --> 00:07:14,290
But this demonic energy

144
00:07:14,480 --> 00:07:16,290
must be mine.

145
00:07:17,040 --> 00:07:18,930
Senior Sister went to such lengths

146
00:07:18,920 --> 00:07:21,170
to lure me into using the Demonic Finger

147
00:07:20,960 --> 00:07:23,090
just to obtain its demonic energy.

148
00:07:23,280 --> 00:07:25,010
If you had asked me directly,

149
00:07:25,080 --> 00:07:27,170
Junior Brother might not have minded.

150
00:07:27,440 --> 00:07:29,010
But now,

151
00:07:29,360 --> 00:07:31,330
I won't let you

152
00:07:31,560 --> 00:07:32,610
steal it !

153
00:07:37,720 --> 00:07:38,770
Seventh Brother,

154
00:07:38,840 --> 00:07:40,690
I just want a bit of your demonic energy.

155
00:07:40,840 --> 00:07:42,490
This is very important for me.

156
00:07:42,440 --> 00:07:43,730
If you agree,

157
00:07:43,640 --> 00:07:45,290
I’ll give up immediately.

158
00:07:46,040 --> 00:07:47,690
Otherwise...

159
00:07:48,160 --> 00:07:49,410
I can't grant you

160
00:07:49,760 --> 00:07:51,010
this favor.

161
00:07:54,520 --> 00:07:55,530
Alright,

162
00:07:55,760 --> 00:07:57,530
if you don’t use your Demonic Finger,

163
00:07:57,720 --> 00:07:59,570
I wonder how long you'll last.

164
00:08:02,240 --> 00:08:03,890
The Nine Cycle Celestial Refining Tactic ?

165
00:08:04,560 --> 00:08:06,410
This spell is extremely difficult to cultivate

166
00:08:06,560 --> 00:08:08,490
and I just gave him the jade slip.

167
00:08:08,640 --> 00:08:10,130
How could he possibly

168
00:08:10,640 --> 00:08:12,090
have already mastered it !?

169
00:08:15,080 --> 00:08:16,250
Junior Brother,

170
00:08:16,440 --> 00:08:17,970
your three cycles

171
00:08:18,280 --> 00:08:19,570
are useless against me !

172
00:08:19,840 --> 00:08:21,170
Now...

173
00:08:21,520 --> 00:08:23,290
it’s five cycles !

174
00:08:30,840 --> 00:08:32,290
This child...

175
00:08:32,040 --> 00:08:35,890
Is he really a fit for my Dao ?

176
00:08:36,640 --> 00:08:37,970
Back then,

177
00:08:37,720 --> 00:08:40,050
he left me with a single phrase.

178
00:08:40,560 --> 00:08:42,010
"My Dao

179
00:08:41,880 --> 00:08:43,730
is the Dao of Heavenly Fate."

180
00:08:44,680 --> 00:08:47,770
Only by finding people who fit my Dao

181
00:08:47,840 --> 00:08:51,130
will I have a chance to enter the third step.

182
00:08:52,880 --> 00:08:54,730
It's been more than 30 000 years

183
00:08:54,640 --> 00:08:57,090
and I’ve already failed countless times.

184
00:08:57,760 --> 00:08:59,290
Am I

185
00:08:59,040 --> 00:09:00,930
doing it right ?

186
00:09:01,640 --> 00:09:03,410
Am I wrong ?

187
00:09:06,040 --> 00:09:08,010
Do you still want to see

188
00:09:08,440 --> 00:09:11,090
my Nine Cycle Celestial Refining Tactic's strength ?

189
00:09:15,240 --> 00:09:16,890
I really underestimated you.

190
00:09:17,200 --> 00:09:18,290
Seventh Brother,

191
00:09:18,760 --> 00:09:20,290
I give up.

192
00:09:20,960 --> 00:09:23,210
Even Senior Sister Xinmeng couldn’t defeat him ?

193
00:09:23,360 --> 00:09:25,210
Wang Lin is exceptionally talented.

194
00:09:25,280 --> 00:09:26,650
The Son of Tian Yun

195
00:09:26,960 --> 00:09:29,170
will be given to the new disciple ?

196
00:09:29,280 --> 00:09:30,210
Indeed...

197
00:09:30,240 --> 00:09:31,490
I'm so jealous !

198
00:09:31,480 --> 00:09:34,410
When will we become Sons of Tian Yun ?

199
00:09:40,960 --> 00:09:42,170
Such momentum...

200
00:09:42,920 --> 00:09:44,410
This person’s cultivation

201
00:09:44,480 --> 00:09:46,090
must be Ascendant.

202
00:09:46,640 --> 00:09:48,050
Disciple Chen Tao

203
00:09:48,040 --> 00:09:49,530
pays respects to Master.

204
00:09:46,120 --> 00:09:49,530
Chen Tao
Heavenly Fate Sect
Purple Division disciple
Middle stage Ascendant

205
00:09:51,920 --> 00:09:53,650
Chen Tao ?

206
00:09:54,680 --> 00:09:57,490
If Sun Yun hadn't suddenly emerged back then,

207
00:09:57,640 --> 00:09:59,890
the Purple Division's Son of Tian Yun

208
00:10:00,160 --> 00:10:02,970
would likely still be Chen Tao.

209
00:10:05,120 --> 00:10:06,970
You made it back in time,

210
00:10:07,040 --> 00:10:08,490
very good !

211
00:10:09,000 --> 00:10:11,490
Disciple originally wasn't going to be late

212
00:10:11,280 --> 00:10:13,490
but when I passed planet Black Ink,

213
00:10:13,280 --> 00:10:15,290
I saw a rare treasure there.

214
00:10:15,440 --> 00:10:17,210
Disciple took a liking to it

215
00:10:17,160 --> 00:10:18,890
and wished to gift it to Master.

216
00:10:19,040 --> 00:10:20,770
That's why I was delayed.

217
00:10:21,040 --> 00:10:22,890
What kind of treasure

218
00:10:22,760 --> 00:10:24,690
caught your eye ?

219
00:10:25,040 --> 00:10:26,890
Disciple found this on planet Black Ink,

220
00:10:26,640 --> 00:10:29,290
3 high-quality Desolate Beasts were fighting over it.

221
00:10:29,440 --> 00:10:31,330
Disciple was curious, so I took it.

222
00:10:32,480 --> 00:10:34,410
Unfortunately, my knowledge is limited.

223
00:10:34,640 --> 00:10:35,570
I don't know

224
00:10:35,440 --> 00:10:37,210
what it is exactly.

225
00:10:39,240 --> 00:10:42,570
This flower is called the Seven-Colored Glaze.

226
00:10:42,840 --> 00:10:44,490
It takes 10 years to take root,

227
00:10:44,360 --> 00:10:45,930
100 years to make leaves,

228
00:10:46,040 --> 00:10:48,090
1000 years to make a bud,

229
00:10:48,760 --> 00:10:50,050
10 000 years

230
00:10:50,160 --> 00:10:52,570
for it to bloom.

231
00:10:53,360 --> 00:10:55,330
After it blooms 7 times,

232
00:10:55,320 --> 00:10:58,370
it releases a 7-colored light.

233
00:10:59,520 --> 00:11:01,490
The Cultivation Alliance

234
00:11:01,760 --> 00:11:02,890
ranks this item

235
00:11:02,800 --> 00:11:06,210
as the 93rd heavenly treasure.

236
00:11:07,560 --> 00:11:09,170
Elder Sun,

237
00:11:09,240 --> 00:11:11,610
is this old man correct ?

238
00:11:12,600 --> 00:11:13,730
That is correct.

239
00:11:14,240 --> 00:11:17,850
This is indeed a Seven-Colored Glaze.

240
00:11:17,840 --> 00:11:20,370
Senior All-Seer’s outstanding disciples

241
00:11:20,120 --> 00:11:22,890
are truly a breath of fresh air.

242
00:11:23,440 --> 00:11:24,690
Good...

243
00:11:24,840 --> 00:11:26,130
I will

244
00:11:26,280 --> 00:11:28,530
accept your gift.

245
00:11:28,880 --> 00:11:29,890
Master,

246
00:11:30,120 --> 00:11:31,970
disciple has returned

247
00:11:31,840 --> 00:11:34,570
to reclaim the title of Son of Tian Yun.

248
00:11:35,080 --> 00:11:37,530
I humbly ask for Master’s blessing.

249
00:11:37,840 --> 00:11:40,050
The victor between you two

250
00:11:40,120 --> 00:11:43,810
shall be the Purple Division's Son of Tian Yun.

251
00:11:48,480 --> 00:11:49,690
You

252
00:11:50,120 --> 00:11:51,850
should give up !

253
00:12:08,440 --> 00:12:10,170
This isn't how

254
00:12:10,320 --> 00:12:12,010
this spell should be used.

255
00:12:12,840 --> 00:12:14,690
Only in the hands of an Ascendant cultivator

256
00:12:15,080 --> 00:12:17,250
can this spell truly be called

257
00:12:17,960 --> 00:12:19,890
the Nine Cycle Celestial Refining Tactic.

258
00:12:21,880 --> 00:12:23,410
With such a low cultivation,

259
00:12:23,640 --> 00:12:26,370
you're unworthy of being my Seventh Junior Brother !

260
00:12:28,120 --> 00:12:29,370
Teleportation !

261
00:12:37,240 --> 00:12:38,930
Teleportation

262
00:12:38,920 --> 00:12:40,690
to turn his spell against him ?

263
00:12:41,040 --> 00:12:43,690
That's a clever way to fight an Ascendant.

264
00:12:43,440 --> 00:12:46,890
Those kinds of tricks won't change anything.

265
00:12:47,040 --> 00:12:49,450
Are you trying to outsmart me ?

266
00:12:49,560 --> 00:12:50,610
It's useless !

267
00:12:52,160 --> 00:12:53,370
Beast Soul,

268
00:12:53,240 --> 00:12:54,290
come out !

269
00:12:54,920 --> 00:12:56,210
Devour him !

270
00:12:57,480 --> 00:12:59,490
You snarling beast,

271
00:12:59,760 --> 00:13:01,330
come and play with me !

272
00:13:02,680 --> 00:13:04,410
God Slaying Chariot,

273
00:13:05,000 --> 00:13:06,490
fifth seal,

274
00:13:06,720 --> 00:13:07,690
release !

275
00:13:11,280 --> 00:13:12,370
This is...

276
00:13:17,680 --> 00:13:19,490
Interesting...

277
00:13:20,280 --> 00:13:22,610
This fight against an Ascendant allows me

278
00:13:22,360 --> 00:13:25,290
to use Chen Tao's strength to fight the Beast Soul

279
00:13:25,040 --> 00:13:26,890
and lessens the backlash from undoing the seal.

280
00:13:26,840 --> 00:13:29,210
That was my best opportunity to open the seal.

281
00:13:30,320 --> 00:13:31,690
When I release

282
00:13:31,840 --> 00:13:34,090
all 5 seals on this beast,

283
00:13:34,440 --> 00:13:36,410
I wonder how powerful

284
00:13:36,160 --> 00:13:38,130
the God Slaying Chariot will be.

285
00:13:39,240 --> 00:13:40,250
Good !

286
00:13:40,120 --> 00:13:41,170
Very good !

287
00:13:41,440 --> 00:13:43,090
If you can subdue this beast,

288
00:13:43,560 --> 00:13:46,410
then you're qualified to be my Junior Brother !

289
00:13:46,160 --> 00:13:47,090
You

290
00:13:47,240 --> 00:13:50,090
are not yet qualified to be my Senior Brother.

291
00:13:50,240 --> 00:13:52,610
I'll take the time to fight this beast

292
00:13:52,840 --> 00:13:54,810
and then I'll deal with you.

293
00:13:54,720 --> 00:13:56,410
It doesn't change anything.

294
00:13:56,440 --> 00:13:57,730
We will see

295
00:13:58,160 --> 00:14:00,170
if I’m qualified !

296
00:14:06,160 --> 00:14:07,450
Wang Lin,

297
00:14:07,720 --> 00:14:10,130
do you dare to take my strike ?

298
00:14:11,920 --> 00:14:13,490
Why would I not ?

299
00:14:14,840 --> 00:14:17,530
This final killing spell has immense backlash.

300
00:14:17,840 --> 00:14:19,530
Use it responsibly

301
00:14:19,800 --> 00:14:21,890
before Late stage Soul Transformation.

302
00:14:22,240 --> 00:14:24,610
You must wait until Ascendant

303
00:14:24,880 --> 00:14:27,290
before you can use it freely.

304
00:14:27,360 --> 00:14:28,410
Under...

305
00:14:28,440 --> 00:14:29,690
world...

306
00:14:29,760 --> 00:14:30,890
Finger !

307
00:14:37,360 --> 00:14:38,890
This finger...

308
00:14:38,840 --> 00:14:41,770
Why is it the same as that madman's

309
00:14:41,840 --> 00:14:44,010
that I met earlier ?

310
00:14:47,840 --> 00:14:50,570
The Life and Death Reincarnation Cycle Domain....

311
00:14:59,840 --> 00:15:01,290
Here it comes !

312
00:15:09,480 --> 00:15:11,290
He's only Soul Transformation

313
00:15:11,160 --> 00:15:13,570
and he's able to push an Ascendant this far !

314
00:15:23,480 --> 00:15:24,770
That's enough.

315
00:15:25,640 --> 00:15:26,690
Master,

316
00:15:26,600 --> 00:15:27,850
disciple gives up.

317
00:15:34,840 --> 00:15:36,690
When you reach Ascendant,

318
00:15:36,720 --> 00:15:38,170
we shall fight again,

319
00:15:38,280 --> 00:15:39,490
Seventh Brother.

320
00:15:40,440 --> 00:15:43,290
You are both my disciples,

321
00:15:43,040 --> 00:15:45,730
don't be jealous of each other.

322
00:15:46,320 --> 00:15:47,530
Chen Tao,

323
00:15:47,960 --> 00:15:49,730
since you won

324
00:15:49,920 --> 00:15:51,970
you shall be once more

325
00:15:51,720 --> 00:15:54,570
the Purple Division's Son of Tian Yun.

326
00:15:55,760 --> 00:15:58,490
This is not your first time receiving the title,

327
00:15:58,640 --> 00:16:00,770
take your time to comprehend it.

328
00:16:01,560 --> 00:16:02,930
Thank you, Master.

329
00:16:03,240 --> 00:16:05,290
Now I'm sure that there is something else

330
00:16:05,040 --> 00:16:06,690
to the Seven Sons of Tian Yun.

331
00:16:07,040 --> 00:16:09,610
Before I learn what that crystal is,

332
00:16:09,760 --> 00:16:11,410
I mustn't become one.

333
00:16:12,440 --> 00:16:14,290
Fortunately, Chen Tao returned.

334
00:16:14,760 --> 00:16:17,330
Since I fought an Ascendant with all I have,

335
00:16:18,240 --> 00:16:20,290
I avoided offending the All-Seer

336
00:16:20,840 --> 00:16:23,250
and avoided becoming a Son of Tian Yun.

337
00:16:26,040 --> 00:16:27,290
Esteemed guests,

338
00:16:27,440 --> 00:16:31,290
this is the end of this old man's birthday.

339
00:16:31,760 --> 00:16:33,930
Fellow cultivators, if you don't have urgent matters,

340
00:16:34,040 --> 00:16:37,130
please stay at my Heavenly Fate Sect for a few more days

341
00:16:37,840 --> 00:16:39,810
to discuss the Dao

342
00:16:39,960 --> 00:16:42,610
and share our enlightenments.

343
00:16:42,360 --> 00:16:45,690
Farewell, Senior All-Seer.

344
00:16:45,760 --> 00:16:46,850
Wang Lin,

345
00:16:47,480 --> 00:16:50,170
come with me to pay respects to the Ancestral Spirit.

346
00:16:50,000 --> 00:16:54,490
Afterward, I will teach you a forbidden spell and give you a life-saving artifact.

347
00:16:55,240 --> 00:16:56,530
From now on,

348
00:16:56,880 --> 00:16:59,490
you officially become

349
00:16:59,800 --> 00:17:02,010
my disciple.

350
00:17:02,520 --> 00:17:03,730
Thank you, Master.

351
00:17:04,210 --> 00:17:13,770
"I always decide which
forbidden spell each student will learn, but if you can see through
the mysteries of this mountain, Master will break the rules and
let you choose whichever spell you want."

352
00:17:07,800 --> 00:17:10,930
Three Black and White Peaks
Heavenly Fate Sect

353
00:17:14,480 --> 00:17:15,810
Wang Lin,

354
00:17:15,840 --> 00:17:17,810
what do you think of this place ?

355
00:17:18,440 --> 00:17:20,130
This place is rich in cold Yin energy.

356
00:17:20,440 --> 00:17:23,770
It's a great place to cultivate cold-type techniques.

357
00:17:25,440 --> 00:17:26,850
Is that all ?

358
00:17:29,880 --> 00:17:31,690
This mountain is completely black.

359
00:17:32,080 --> 00:17:34,330
Even the snow falling on it is black.

360
00:17:34,840 --> 00:17:37,610
However, this black snow isn't cold, it gives off a strange aura.

361
00:17:37,640 --> 00:17:39,850
The central mountain's aura

362
00:17:39,840 --> 00:17:41,090
is even stranger.

363
00:17:42,320 --> 00:17:43,530
Oh ?

364
00:17:44,040 --> 00:17:45,290
Continue.

365
00:17:46,440 --> 00:17:48,130
This mountain is so strange

366
00:17:48,640 --> 00:17:50,050
because I can sense

367
00:17:49,800 --> 00:17:51,770
a hint of Life from it.

368
00:17:53,080 --> 00:17:55,490
Although all beings possess Life energy,

369
00:17:56,040 --> 00:17:57,410
it's the first time

370
00:17:57,160 --> 00:17:59,290
that I have seen a mountain

371
00:17:59,880 --> 00:18:01,370
with Life energy.

372
00:18:03,560 --> 00:18:05,650
Is that all ?

373
00:18:05,920 --> 00:18:07,410
It's not enough.

374
00:18:10,160 --> 00:18:11,330
Master,

375
00:18:11,800 --> 00:18:13,970
those two side mountains are fake.

376
00:18:20,840 --> 00:18:23,490
This child's intellect is exceptional

377
00:18:23,360 --> 00:18:25,690
and his domain is quite interesting.

378
00:18:26,160 --> 00:18:28,090
He was able to use his domain

379
00:18:27,840 --> 00:18:30,090
to see through my spell.

380
00:18:29,920 --> 00:18:32,930
Detecting such clues with his Soul Transformation cultivation

381
00:18:33,480 --> 00:18:35,530
is pretty impressive.

382
00:18:38,120 --> 00:18:40,130
The All-Seer's cultivation is heavenly.

383
00:18:40,840 --> 00:18:42,890
If not for Tu Si's memories

384
00:18:42,640 --> 00:18:45,290
I wouldn't have seen the truth behind these mountains.

385
00:18:51,840 --> 00:18:53,970
Judging from the All-Seer's reaction,

386
00:18:54,640 --> 00:18:56,050
maybe...

387
00:18:56,680 --> 00:19:00,130
he doesn't know that I have memories of an Ancient God.

388
00:19:05,560 --> 00:19:07,050
Wang Lin,

389
00:19:07,240 --> 00:19:09,690
Master will wait for you at the summit.

390
00:19:10,560 --> 00:19:12,890
The first 100 steps will be easy

391
00:19:12,640 --> 00:19:15,690
with your Soul Transformation cultivation.

392
00:19:16,280 --> 00:19:18,490
But the final 100 steps to the summit

393
00:19:18,240 --> 00:19:20,810
will depend on your fate.

394
00:19:23,440 --> 00:19:25,530
Those final 100 steps

395
00:19:26,000 --> 00:19:28,250
are what Master calls

396
00:19:28,440 --> 00:19:30,810
the Shattered Land of the Celestials.

397
00:19:41,000 --> 00:19:46,890
I've been walking this path for endless years

398
00:19:43,300 --> 00:19:46,890
just to catch a glimpse of your silhouette.

399
00:19:47,280 --> 00:19:52,490
Is it the compass of fate

400
00:19:49,120 --> 00:19:52,490
that wrote this outcome for us ?

401
00:19:52,400 --> 00:19:58,410
The heavens want to erase your existence,

402
00:19:58,280 --> 00:20:04,130
that's the obsession guiding me.

403
00:20:04,160 --> 00:20:09,730
Is this the path to uncover

404
00:20:06,040 --> 00:20:09,730
truths from falsehoods ?

405
00:20:09,760 --> 00:20:15,330
In a world of murk and shadow,

406
00:20:11,660 --> 00:20:15,330
only the flame of truth can light the way.

407
00:20:15,120 --> 00:20:21,050
Look at them all,

408
00:20:18,000 --> 00:20:21,050
being carried by the waves.

409
00:20:21,240 --> 00:20:25,690
Look at them all,

410
00:20:23,400 --> 00:20:25,690
being drowned.

411
00:20:25,520 --> 00:20:29,010
I don't want to believe in whoever decides fate,

412
00:20:28,800 --> 00:20:32,090
I will let the world refine my soul.

413
00:20:31,970 --> 00:20:37,650
So what if I become an Immortal and defy the heavens ?

414
00:20:33,660 --> 00:20:37,650
I will fight.

415
00:20:37,400 --> 00:20:40,770
I'll break through the abyss of despair

416
00:20:40,520 --> 00:20:43,810
to finally learn who I really am.

417
00:20:43,560 --> 00:20:49,170
My body is stained by the bloody color of slaughter,

418
00:20:45,440 --> 00:20:49,170
I embrace this obsession.

419
00:20:48,920 --> 00:20:52,130
I won't glance back at the wasteland I left behind.

420
00:20:51,880 --> 00:20:54,930
Even if this suffering shatters my soul

421
00:20:54,680 --> 00:21:00,410
and I'm reborn countless times in hell,

422
00:20:56,720 --> 00:21:00,410
I'll still fight.

423
00:21:00,360 --> 00:21:03,770
It's hard to avoid loneliness

424
00:21:03,520 --> 00:21:06,810
when you are above everyone else.

425
00:21:06,560 --> 00:21:12,490
Can a moth that has witnessed the flames of a Suzaku

426
00:21:08,880 --> 00:21:12,490
be afraid of a firefly ?
